.claude/
.kiro/

# graphify knowledge graph — regenerable (run /graphify or `graphify --update`)
graphify-out/

# Agent instruction files — written for whoever is driving this repo on this
# machine, not for people reading the code. CLAUDE.md carries machine-specific
# operational state (a ~/.config hardlink, which processes not to kill);
# AGENTS.md is an architecture summary aimed at agents, and docs/ covers the same
# ground for humans. Both stay local.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Superseded dashboard pages, kept on disk as a reference while the split pages
# settle. /admin/classic (adminPage.js) is the live rollback path, so these two
# are no longer reachable and do not belong in the published tree.
src/routes/logPage.js
src/routes/spendPage.js

# Placeholder for a build output that was never used — the dashboard is rendered
# server-side with no build step.
dashboard/

# vendor-facing report — quotes provider ids/usage from a specific account's
# traffic, not something to publish with the code
lumosel-token-report.md

# Reseller evaluation notes. Names specific vendors and makes critical, legally
# exposed claims about them — pricing, which plan silently fails, evidence that a
# "claude-" route serves a different model, leaked upstream chains. Genuinely
# useful locally; publishing it invites a dispute and dates badly as vendors
# change. Kept out of the repo, not deleted.
docs/provider-findings.md
